There is no secondary collaborator note available, so I only have the primary guidance to consider.

Based on the policy, my next step is to continue investigating the misconfigured endpoint internally and provide you with a summary of the corrective actions taken, without sharing the raw logs. I will also update the ticket status to 'awaiting_customer' once I have that summary ready for your review. Does this approach work for you, or do you have any specific information you need that doesn't involve internal logs?"
}

